---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Marketing Accountability Audit" description="Not sure if your dental marketing agency is actually working? We audit 90 days of traffic, call tracking, and GA4 data — and give you a straight answer.">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-teal/10 text-brand-teal text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">For Dental Practice Owners</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight mb-6">
          You're Paying for Marketing.<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">But Is It Actually Working?</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          Most dental practices can't answer that question — not because they're unsophisticated, but because their agency hasn't set up the infrastructure to answer it. We can tell you exactly what's working, what isn't, and why.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-slate hover:bg-brand-dark text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors">
            Start with a Free 15-Minute Conversation &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROBLEM -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">Sound Familiar?</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">
        The Problem Isn't Your Budget.<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">It's the Lack of Accountability.</em>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">Vanity Metrics, No New Patients</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your monthly report is full of impressions, clicks, and CTR. But you can't tell if a single new patient walked through the door because of that spend.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">Spend Not Tied to Calls or Bookings</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">There's no line connecting your ad budget to the calls that came in or the appointments that were booked. You're flying blind on what's actually driving revenue.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">Don't Know What to Ask</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">You suspect something is off but you don't know the right questions to ask your agency. And without a clinical background in marketing analytics, it's easy to get a confident non-answer.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE DO -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">The Audit</p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight">
            A Systematic Review of<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">What Your Data Actually Says</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg">We look at the next 90 days of data across every channel your agency is running — and we trace spend to outcomes, not just traffic.</p>
          <p>Dr. Wank brings a DMD's diagnostic instinct to marketing analysis. Just as you wouldn't treat symptoms without understanding the cause, we don't make recommendations without understanding exactly where the breakdown is happening in your marketing funnel.</p>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100 space-y-4">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark">What We Analyze</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                '90-day paid and organic traffic analysis by channel and campaign',
                'Call tracking attribution — which ads drove inbound calls',
                'GA4 conversion review — what counts as a conversion and whether it maps to actual bookings',
                'Channel-by-channel breakdown: Google Ads, Meta, SEO, local listings',
                'Landing page and form performance review',
                'Budget allocation vs. outcome mapping',
              ].map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-colors text-sm">
            Start with a Free 15-Minute Conversation
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-brand-slate rounded-2xl p-7 text-white">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Why a Dentist Is Running This Audit</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Most marketing consultants learned dentistry by reading about it. Dr. Wank practiced it. That means he knows what a patient decision cycle actually looks like, what a high-value case is worth, and how to translate clinical goals into trackable marketing outcomes — without getting lost in jargon or distracted by metrics that don't move the chair.</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              {[
                'Diagnostic approach to marketing data',
                'Understandng of patient psychology',
                'Straight answers — not agency spin',
              ].map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-teal">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                  </svg>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-3">Who This Is For</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">You don't need to be ready to switch agencies. You just need to want a clear answer.</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              {[
                'Practices spending $2,000–$20,000/month on marketing',
                'Owners who have never seen call-level attribution data',
                'Practices whose agency reports on clicks but not appointments',
                'Specialists who suspect their current campaign isn\'t converting the right cases',
              ].map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT YOU GET -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-brand-slate text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 text-center">Deliverables</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-dark text-center mb-12">
        What You Walk Away With
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-teal text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">Written Audit Report</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">A clear, jargon-free document showing exactly what we found — channel by channel, campaign by campaign. Something you can read yourself and share with your agency.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-red text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">Call Attribution Summary</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">A breakdown of which channels and campaigns are driving inbound calls — and which are generating traffic with no measurable patient contact at the other end.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-slate text-white font-display font-semibold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-2">An Honest Verdict</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Working. Not working. Partially working — here's why. We don't hedge. You'll know exactly where your marketing stands and what, if anything, needs to change.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BOTTOM CTA -->
  <section class="bg-brand-slate py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">
        Start with a Free<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">15-Minute Conversation</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">No pitch, no pressure. We'll ask a few questions about your current marketing, tell you what we'd look at, and let you decide if it's worth going deeper.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-md transition-colors">
          Book a Free 15-Minute Call &rarr;
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center border border-white/40 text-white hover:bg-white/10 font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-md transition-colors">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
